<div class="steps">
	<div class="steps__stain steps__stain--top"></div>
	<div class="steps__layout">
		<div class="steps__header section__header">
			<div class="steps__title section__title">Steps to get started</div>
		</div>
		<div class="steps__body">
			<div class="steps__list">
				<div class="steps__item step">
					<div class="step__number"><span>1</span></div>
					<div class="step__title">Understand the problem</div>
					<div class="step__desc">We clarify your goals, the available data and resources, and how we will judge success.</div>
				</div>
				<div class="steps__item step">
					<div class="step__number"><span>2</span></div>
					<div class="step__title">Choose an approach</div>
					<div class="step__desc">We assess feasible options, agree on scope and choose the tools and evaluation methods.</div>
				</div>
				<div class="steps__item step">
					<div class="step__number"><span>3</span></div>
					<div class="step__title">Agree on a plan</div>
					<div class="step__desc">I propose concrete deliverables, milestones and timelines.</div>
				</div>
				<div class="steps__item step">
					<div class="step__number"><span>4</span></div>
					<div class="step__title">Build & review</div>
					<div class="step__desc">I deliver incrementally, usually with visible progress each week, and adjust the work using your feedback.</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
